# mods.map - which build goes with which mod, and what to call it.
#
# Columns (whitespace separated; '#' starts a comment):
#   1  gamedir      the mod's folder name, as it appears on disk
#   2  branch       FWGS/hlsdk-portable branch we build it from (dist/mods/<branch>/)
#   3  server_dll   fallback basename for the server dylib, WITHOUT extension
#   4  title        display name
#
# The server dylib's real name is read from the mod's own liblist.gam at install
# time (`gamedll "dlls\survivor.dll"` -> survivor.dylib). Column 3 is only used
# when a mod ships without a liblist.gam. Do NOT derive these from the branch's
# mod_options.txt: several branches disagree with what the mod actually ships -
# residual_point declares rp_pub/rp but ships rp/ + survivor.dylib, caseclosed
# declares caseclosed but ships cc/, CAd declares CAd but ships cad/.
#
# The client dylib is always cl_dlls/client.dylib, on every mod.

# gamedir        branch             server_dll   title
aom              aom                hl           Afraid of Monsters
asheep           asheep             hl           Azure Sheep
biglolly         biglolly           bl           Big Lolly
blackops         blackops           hl           Black Ops
bshift           bshift             bshift       Blue Shift
cad              CAd                hl           Cleaners Adventures
cc               caseclosed         cc           Case Closed
dmc              dmc                dmc          Deathmatch Classic
echoes           echoes             echoes       Echoes
eftd             eftd               hl           Escape from the Darkness
gearbox          opfor              opfor        Opposing Force
half-screwed     half-screwed       hl           Half-Screwed
Hunger           theyhunger         einar        They Hunger
induction        induction_1.2      hl           Induction
noffice          noffice            nato         Night at the Office
poke646          poke646            hl           Poke 646
redempt          redempt            redempt      Redemption
rp               residual_point     survivor     Residual Point
shall            halloween          spirit       Swiss Cheese Halloween
TheGate          thegate            hl           The Gate
tot              tot                hl           Times of Troubles
vendetta         poke646_vendetta   hl           Poke 646 Vendetta
visitors         visitors           hl           Visitors
xenwar           sohl1.2            libserver    Xen Warrior
Zombie-X-DLE     zombie-x           zx           Zombie-X

